msgstr "参考[特性指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)获取特性的配置。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:17
msgid "3 Prerequisites"
msgstr "3 前提条件"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:19
msgid "3.1 Model Weight"
msgstr "3.1 模型权重"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:21
msgid ""
"Download the [Eco-Tech/Kimi-K3-w4a8](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Kimi-K3-w4a8) ModelSlim W4A8 quantized weight from ModelScope. "
"Deploying this weight requires at least 4 Atlas 800 A3 (64G × 16) nodes."
msgstr ""
"从 ModelScope 下载 [Eco-"
"Tech/Kimi-K3-w4a8](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/Kimi-K3-w4a8) "
"ModelSlim W4A8 量化权重。部署该权重至少需要 4 个 Atlas 800 A3 (64G × 16) 节点。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:23
msgid ""
"The local implementation supports Kimi K3 ModelSlim quantization through "
"`--quantization ascend`. For a checkpoint that already contains a "
"`compressed-tensors` quantization configuration, omit `--quantization "
"ascend` and let vLLM discover the quantization method from the checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"本地实现通过 `--quantization ascend` 支持 Kimi K3 ModelSlim 量化。对于已包含 `compressed-"
"tensors` 量化配置的检查点，省略 `--quantization ascend`，让 vLLM 从检查点自动发现量化方法。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:25
msgid ""
"The checkpoint directory must contain the model configuration, tokenizer, "
"image processor, and model weight files required by the published Kimi K3 "
"package."
msgstr "检查点目录必须包含已发布的 Kimi K3 包所需的模型配置、分词器、图像处理器和模型权重文件。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:27
msgid ""
"It is recommended to download the model weight to the shared directory of "
"multiple nodes, such as `/root/.cache/`."
msgstr "建议将模型权重下载到多节点共享目录，例如 `/root/.cache/`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:29
msgid "3.2 Verify Multi-node Communication (Optional)"
msgstr "3.2 验证多节点通信（可选）"

