#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:99
msgid "5.1 Four-Node Mixed Deployment"
msgstr "5.1 四节点混合部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:101
msgid ""
"The validated mixed deployment uses four Atlas 800 A3 (64G × 16) nodes. vLLM"
" data parallelism spans the four nodes, each node runs one DP rank, and "
"tensor parallelism uses all 16 NPUs in the node. The resulting topology is "
"DP4/TP16/EP64."
msgstr ""
"验证的混合部署使用四个 Atlas 800 A3 (64G × 16) 节点。vLLM 数据并行跨越四个节点，每个节点运行一个 DP "
"rank，张量并行使用节点内的全部 16 个 NPU。最终拓扑为 DP4/TP16/EP64。"

