msgid "`NIC_NAME` must be the interface that owns `LOCAL_IP`."
msgstr "`NIC_NAME` 必须是拥有 `LOCAL_IP` 的接口。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:107
msgid ""
"Start Node 0 first. The `NODE0_IP` configured on Nodes 1 through 3 must "
"equal `LOCAL_IP` on Node 0."
msgstr "先启动节点 0。节点 1 到 3 上配置的 `NODE0_IP` 必须等于节点 0 上的 `LOCAL_IP`。"

