#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:275
msgid "5.2 Sixteen-Node PD Separation Deployment"
msgstr "5.2 十六节点PD分离部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:277
msgid ""
"The validated PD separation topology uses 16 Atlas 800 A3 (64G × 16) nodes: "
"eight Prefill nodes and eight Decode nodes. Both sides use DP8/TP16/PP1. "
"Prefill nodes additionally use a memcache-backed KV pool."
msgstr ""
"已验证的PD分离拓扑使用16个Atlas 800 A3（64G × "
"16）节点：八个Prefill节点和八个Decode节点。两侧均使用DP8/TP16/PP1。Prefill节点额外使用memcache支持的KV池。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:279
msgid ""
"Refer to [PD Disaggregation with "
"Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) for the "
"general service workflow and [KV "
"Pool](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md) for memcache pool concepts."
msgstr ""
"有关通用服务工作流，请参考[使用Mooncake进行PD分离](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)；有关memcache池概念，请参考[KV池](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_pool.md)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:281
msgid "5.2.1 Start the memcache MetaService"
msgstr "5.2.1 启动memcache MetaService"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:283
msgid "Start one MetaService instance before the Prefill engines:"
msgstr "在Prefill引擎之前启动一个MetaService实例："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:290
msgid ""
"`mmc-meta.conf` configures MetaService and `mmc-local.conf` is loaded by "
"every Prefill inference process. Run `pip show memcache_hybrid` to locate "
"the installed package, copy the example files from "
"`memcache_hybrid/config/`, and adapt them to the target environment."
msgstr ""
"`mmc-meta.conf`配置MetaService，`mmc-local.conf`由每个Prefill推理进程加载。运行`pip show "
"memcache_hybrid`定位已安装的包，从`memcache_hybrid/config/`复制示例文件，并根据目标环境进行调整。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:292
msgid "5.2.2 Create the engine templates"
