#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:801
msgid ""
"**Q: Which multimodal inputs are supported by the current Kimi K3 "
"implementation?**"
msgstr "**问：当前的 Kimi K3 实现支持哪些多模态输入？**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:803
msgid ""
"A: The current local processor accepts image inputs. Video inputs are not "
"supported."
msgstr "答：当前的本地处理器接受图像输入。不支持视频输入。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:805
msgid ""
"**Q: Which server options are required for Kimi K3 reasoning and tool "
"calling?**"
msgstr "**问：Kimi K3 推理和工具调用需要哪些服务器选项？**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:807
msgid ""
"A: Configure `--enable-auto-tool-choice`, `--reasoning-parser kimi_k3`, and "
"`--tool-call-parser kimi_k3` together."
msgstr ""
"答：一起配置 `--enable-auto-tool-choice`、`--reasoning-parser kimi_k3` 和 `--tool-"
"call-parser kimi_k3`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:809
msgid "**Q: When should `--quantization ascend` be used?**"
msgstr "**问：何时应使用 `--quantization ascend`？**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:811
msgid ""
"A: Use it for ModelSlim native quantized weights. If the checkpoint declares"
" a `compressed-tensors` configuration, omit the option and allow vLLM to "
"load the checkpoint configuration."
msgstr ""
"答：用于 ModelSlim 原生量化权重。如果检查点声明了 `compressed-tensors` 配置，则省略该选项，让 vLLM "
"加载检查点配置。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:813
msgid "**Q: How should TP size be selected?**"
msgstr "**问：如何选择 TP 大小？**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Kimi-K3.md:815
msgid ""
"A: TP size must divide the checkpoint's attention-head count. It also "
"affects KDA state layout and expert placement, so validate memory capacity "
"and communication performance together."
msgstr "答：TP 大小必须能整除检查点的注意力头数。它还会影响 KDA 状态布局和专家放置，因此需要一起验证内存容量和通信性能。"
